                "settings": {
                    "text": "Four tristate buffers drive one bus to the hex digit.\nEach switch of the DIP switch enables one buffer.\nWith no buffer enabled the bus is not driven (Z, blue),\nwith two or more it is undefined (X, red): the digit is blank."
